    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57079" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηθίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dice-box</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.203
			</span></i>:—
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήθιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				27
			</span></i>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηθίδιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.150
			</span></i>.—Wrongly written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κητίον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.477d
			</span></i> cod. A:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείτιον</span></b> , 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείθιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1259.36
			</span></i>. (Ath.l.c. derives it from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείσεται</span>, fut. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χανδάνω</span>.)</div>
